    "short_description": "Since 2016, #FTGA has been honoring #startups and scaleups annually whose business ideas have the potential to shape or fundamentally change the financial sector.\n\nIn the categories Seed Stage, Early Stage, Late Stage, Growth Stage and Most Promising International Startup in Germany, young and growth companies are honored by the top-class FTGA Jury.\n\nIn addition, there are special awards. These are reserved for financial tech sectors that are very young or of strategic or outstanding importance from the Jury's point of view.\n\nThe Jury is a mix of highflyer's in their various fields of expertise, with different perspectives on digital topics in the financial industry. Quite a number of the Jury members have been on board for many years. \n\nThe Jury evaluates and compares the startups in their individual company phases, regardless of the respective #FinTech or #InsurTech subsector, according to various criteria. Based on a scoring process, the leading companies are identified, winners are chosen and ceremoniously honored at the awards ceremony.",
